{
  "name": "Handle WhatsApp voice, image and text support with OpenAI and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c8080008-8888-4888-8888-000000000001",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 1180,
        "content": "## Multimodal WhatsApp Support, Live Order Tool-Calling & Human Takeover Engine\n\n### Who this is for\nE-commerce and service operations teams handling inbound WhatsApp messages (voice notes, product/receipt photos, and text) who need tool-grounded answers from live order & policy tables plus clean human-agent takeover without the AI talking over staff.\n\n### Architecture (3 Coordinated Flows)\n1. **Flow 1 - Deduplication, Human-Takeover Gate & Multimodal Pre-Processing:**\n   - **Supergreen Trigger** (`message`, `onlyIncoming: true`) deduplicates webhook retries via **Remove Duplicates**.\n   - **Human-Takeover Gate:** Looks up the customer's phone in the **Google Sheets** `Tickets` tab first. When `status === 'Human Assigned'`, the workflow bypasses the AI completely and forwards the customer's message straight to your internal support WhatsApp group so staff and AI never talk over each other.\n   - **Voice & Vision Extraction:** Sends a native WhatsApp typing indicator, downloads & transcribes audio voice notes via **OpenAI Whisper**, and inspects customer photos/receipts via **OpenAI Vision (`gpt-4o-mini`)**.\n   - **Tool-Calling AI Operations Agent:** Uses **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** + **Window Memory** + **Structured Output Parser** + **3 live Google Sheets Tools**:\n     - `Lookup Customer Orders` (reads live shipping/order status from `Orders`)\n     - `Search Support Policies` (retrieves verified policies from `KnowledgeBase`)\n     - `Create Return or Action Request` (logs structured RMA/change rows into `OrderActions`)\n   - **Escalation Poll:** Replies to the customer quoting their message, upserts `Tickets`, and when human help is needed, posts a 3-option **Agent Action Poll** (`Claim ticket - pause AI`, `Mark resolved - resume AI`, `Flag urgent refund`) to the support group.\n2. **Flow 2 - Staff Poll Takeover & Resolution Loop (`Supergreen Trigger` on `vote`):**\n   - Matches staff poll votes back to the ticket via `escalationPollId`, toggles `Human Assigned` vs `Resolved` in Google Sheets, and notifies the customer on WhatsApp when resolved.\n3. **Flow 3 - Daily Unresolved SLA Digest (`Schedule Trigger`):**\n   - Audits open `Escalated` / `Human Assigned` tickets older than 4 hours each morning and sends an SLA summary to the support WhatsApp group.\n\n### Google Sheets Tabs Required\n- `Orders`: `orderId`, `phone`, `status`, `carrier`, `trackingUrl`, `items`, `orderDate`\n- `KnowledgeBase`: `topic`, `question`, `policyAnswer`, `updatedAt`\n- `OrderActions`: `createdAt`, `phone`, `orderId`, `actionType`, `reason`\n- `Tickets`: `phone`, `senderName`, `status`, `priority`, `intent`, `summary`, `escalationPollId`, `updatedAt`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8080008-8888-4888-8888-000000000002",
      "name": "Flow 1 Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2880,
        "height": 680,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flow 1: Human-Takeover Check, Voice/Vision Extraction, Multi-Tool AI Agent & Staff Escalation Poll\n\nChecks whether a human agent owns the conversation before running AI, transcribes voice notes, analyzes product photos, queries live `Orders` and `KnowledgeBase` sheets via `ai_tool`, and dispatches interactive takeover polls to staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8080008-8888-4888-8888-000000000003",
      "name": "Flow 2 & 3 Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2200,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Flows 2 & 3: Support Team WhatsApp Poll State Machine (`Claim` / `Resolve`) & Daily Open-SLA Digest\n\nLets support agents pause or re-enable the AI per customer directly from a WhatsApp group poll and sends a daily digest of aging open escalations."
      }
    },
